					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850602,
					"content": "这次的饮品，真好喝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850603,
					"content": "是我目前为止最喜欢的一杯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850604,
					"content": "哇！总算给我们试出哥伦比娅喜欢的口味了，我好感动…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850605,
					"content": "唔…对不起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850606,
					"content": "总结一下，就是不要有明显的苦味，不要直接用果汁，好像不加牛奶比加牛奶更好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850608,
					"content": "这就是「不厚重」的配方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760850609,
					"content": "能够总结出规律也是好事，以后就知道要怎么调制了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850610,
					"content": "…以后？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850611,
					"content": "当然，我们是朋友嘛！你想喝的时候，再跟我们说就好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850612,
					"content": "你该不会是觉得喝了这杯就再也没有了，才一直没舍得喝完吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850613,
					"content": "…唔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850614,
					"content": "放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760850615,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850616,
					"content": "谢谢款待。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
